  <prompt>H10DataverseAppUserGraphParityHandler.cs's ALL 5 seams are ALREADY REAL per DS-4 ('✅ REAL -- all 5 seams DV-REST/Graph-REST via DefaultAzureCredential') -- the ONLY blocker is C5.8: the L2 UAMI's own Graph app-role grants + Dataverse admin rights on TARGET (customer) environments, delivered by task 111's Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1. This task performs LIVE VERIFICATION against a real dev customer-shaped environment (or the existing dev stamp) that H10's 5 seams function correctly now that the grants exist -- NOT a re-implementation. If verification surfaces a genuine code defect (unlikely per DS-4's classification but not ruled out), file it as a new gap, do not silently patch around it in this task without documenting the deviation.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in Dataverse App User creation verification and Graph app-role parity checking against a live environment.</role>

  <goal>A live verification run against a dev target confirms H10's 5 seams (all already-real per DS-4) function correctly end-to-end now that the L2 UAMI holds the C5.8 grants from task 111: Dataverse App User creation for both the customer UAMI and the BFF app-reg, Graph app-role parity assignment/verification, and any remaining seams per H10's existing implementation. A verification report is filed in this project's notes/.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>DS-4 §2 (H10 row) is unambiguous: '✅ REAL -- all 5 seams DV-REST/Graph-REST via DefaultAzureCredential. ~0 code. Blocker is C5.8: grant L2 UAMI Graph app roles + Dataverse admin rights on target envs (Grant-ControlPlaneIdentity.ps1, DS-8 §4). Tests exist.' This is the cleanest case in the entire Wave G'' backlog -- the code is done, only the GRANT (task 111) was missing. This task closes the loop with a live verification, since DS-4 §3 does not flag any deep-dive divergence for H10 (unlike H1/H13/H12b which materially overstated delivery).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/services/Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane.Core/Handlers/DataverseAppUserGraphParity/H10DataverseAppUserGraphParityHandler.cs</file>
