  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing -- H10's 5 seams are ALREADY fully implemented and correct per DS-4's audit; this task does not build anything new. Extension -- N/A, this is verification, not extension. Cost-of-doing-nothing -- without live verification post-grant, Wave G-7's T2/T3 probes (tasks 177/178) would be the FIRST time H10's real-world behavior under the new grants is observed, too late to catch a grant-scoping mistake cheaply.</notes>

